  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the required point be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now from this point, the equation of chord of contact to the ellipse is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>hx</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ky</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> which is same as <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Point of intersection of the tangents is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
